@host = http://localhost:5192

### 1. Create a ticket (201 Created). Status and unit are omitted: Scheduled (statusCode 100) and MT.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ore-dispatch-tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "ticketCode": "3f2b8c9e-6d1a-4b7e-9c55-0a1d2e3f4a5b",
  "truckCode": "CAT-797F-001",
  "dispatchDate": "2026-11-20",
  "shiftCode": "DAY-A",
  "cargoWeightTons": 350.25,
  "oreGrade": "CopperConcentrate",
  "supervisorUsername": "jperez01",
  "fieldObservations": "Loaded at Yanacancha pit"
}

### 2. Same ticketCode again (409 Conflict), message in Spanish
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ore-dispatch-tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es-PE

{
  "ticketCode": "3f2b8c9e-6d1a-4b7e-9c55-0a1d2e3f4a5b",
  "truckCode": "CAT-797F-002",
  "dispatchDate": "2026-11-20",
  "shiftCode": "DAY-A",
  "cargoWeightTons": 350.25,
  "oreGrade": "CopperConcentrate",
  "supervisorUsername": "jperez01",
  "fieldObservations": "Loaded at Yanacancha pit"
}

### 3. Same truck, same dispatch date and shift, new ticketCode (409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ore-dispatch-tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "ticketCode": "aaaaaaaa-1111-4222-8333-444444444444",
  "truckCode": "CAT-797F-001",
  "dispatchDate": "2026-11-20",
  "shiftCode": "day-a",
  "cargoWeightTons": 350.25,
  "oreGrade": "CopperConcentrate",
  "supervisorUsername": "jperez01",
  "fieldObservations": "Loaded at Yanacancha pit"
}

### 4. Truck code with the forbidden correlative 000 (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ore-dispatch-tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "ticketCode": "bbbbbbbb-1111-4222-8333-444444444444",
  "truckCode": "CAT-797F-000",
  "dispatchDate": "2026-11-20",
  "shiftCode": "DAY-A",
  "cargoWeightTons": 350.25,
  "oreGrade": "CopperConcentrate",
  "supervisorUsername": "jperez01",
