### 15. Zinc at its limit (400.00 tons), night shift in lower case, status InTransit (201 Created, statusCode 205)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ore-dispatch-tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "ticketCode": "77777777-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-888888888888",
  "truckCode": "KOM-930E-205",
  "dispatchDate": "2026-11-20",
  "shiftCode": "night-b",
  "cargoWeightTons": 400.0,
  "cargoWeightUnit": "MT",
  "oreGrade": "ZincConcentrate",
  "status": "InTransit",
  "supervisorUsername": "mgarcia02"
}

